@startuml Manager Statistics
title Sequence Diagram: Thống kê & Báo cáo (Task 7)
skinparam theme cerulean

actor Manager
boundary "dashboard.html" as UI
control "StatisticsController" as Ctrl
entity "StatisticsService" as Svc
database "Database" as DB

== Xem báo cáo tổng quan ==
Manager -> UI: Truy cập Dashboard
UI -> Ctrl: GET /api/statistics/overview?startDate=...&endDate=...
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: getGeneralStatistics(startDate, endDate)
activate Svc

Svc -> DB: Query Doanh thu Vé (Sum Booking.totalAmount)
Svc -> DB: Query Doanh thu Combo (Sum BookingCombo.totalPrice)
Svc -> DB: Query Tỷ lệ lấp đầy (Booked Seats / Total Seats)

DB --> Svc: Raw Data
Svc -> Svc: Aggregate & Format Data (Chart.js Format)

Svc --> Ctrl: StatisticsResponse
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> UI: 200 OK (JSON Data)
deactivate Ctrl

UI -> Manager: Hiển thị Biểu đồ Doanh thu & Tỷ lệ lấp đầy
@enduml
